description:
## Task
Add getter methods for Ingested, Skipped, and SkipDetails counters.

## Current state
Only GetProcessed() exists. There are no getters for Ingested, Skipped, or SkipDetails.

## Changes required
In pkg/identity/ingest.go, add after GetProcessed():
```go
// GetIngested returns the total number of records successfully ingested.
func (i *Ingester) GetIngested() int64 {
    return i.Ingested
}

// GetSkipped returns the total number of records skipped.
func (i *Ingester) GetSkipped() int64 {
    return i.Skipped
}

// GetSkipDetails returns the breakdown of skip reasons.
func (i *Ingester) GetSkipDetails() map[SkipReason]int64 {
    return i.SkipDetails
}
```

## Acceptance criteria
- [ ] GetIngested() method added and returns Ingested count
- [ ] GetSkipped() method added and returns Skipped count
- [ ] GetSkipDetails() method added and returns SkipDetails map
- [ ] All existing tests pass
